```astro
---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <Navbar activePage="writeups" />

  <main>
    <section class="writeups-page">
      <div class="writeups-content">
        <p class="section-label">WRITINGS</p>

        <h1>Write-ups are<br /><span>coming soon.</span></h1>

        <p class="intro">
          I'm currently working on documenting things I'm learning,
          exploring, and building along the way.
        </p>

        <p class="closing">
          Technical write-ups, thoughts, reviews, and other writings
          will be added here soon.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .writeups-page {
    min-height: 75vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .writeups-content {
    max-width: 760px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-label {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: #5b9cff;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  h1 span {
    color: #5b9cff;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 32px auto 0;
    color: #aeb8c7;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .closing {
    margin-top: 36px;
    color: #697586;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .writeups-page {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
```
